 "ui/menu.145": "<div class=\"info\"><h3>Controls</h3>\n      <p><b>Phone</b> Drag the left side to move, tap the fist button on the right to attack (hold for combos). Skills are the circles around the fist button.</p>\n      <p><b>Keyboard</b> <span class=\"kb\">WASD/Arrows</span> Move <span class=\"kb\">J/Space</span> Attack <span class=\"kb\">K</span><span class=\"kb\">L</span><span class=\"kb\">;</span> Skills <span class=\"kb\">U</span> Menhera <span class=\"kb\">Q</span>/<span class=\"kb\">E</span> HP/MP food <span class=\"kb\">I</span> Menu</p>\n      <h3>Tips</h3>\n      <p>· When Heesu stands still she pulls out her phone. HP·MP refill much faster while she's on it.</p>\n      <p>· Defeat enough monsters in each zone and the boss appears. Beat the boss to open the exit at the top.</p>\n      <p>· At Lv8 you can learn the ultimate <b>Menhera Attack</b>. Mental damage to every monster on the map!</p>\n      <p>· Skill resets are free, so experiment all you like.</p>\n      <p>· Got spare gold? Enhance your weapon in the Gear tab (no failures up to +10). Raises ATK·Crit.</p>\n      <h3>Records</h3>\n      <p>Play time {v1} · Defeated {kills} · Menhera {ults}× · Food eaten {eaten} · Faints {deaths}</p>\n      <div class=\"row\"><button class=\"btn wh\" data-m=\"sound\">Sound {v2}</button>{v3}<button class=\"btn wh\" data-m=\"title\">To Title</button><button class=\"btn wh\" data-m=\"restart\">Start Over</button></div></div>",
